  "id": "dream-work",
  "term": "dream-work",
  "definition": "Dream-work, in Bion’s account of alpha-functioning, is the mental activity that forms meaningful links to inner and outer experience. It helps create a contact-barrier that separates conscious awareness from the unconscious mind.",
